window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Great Dane. A deer. A dove. A pit bull. And something lurking just beyond the veil of dreams.<br> <br> Adonis never expected to become a legend, he just followed his heart. When the harlequin Great Dane rescues an injured deer named Jericho, it sparks an unlikely friendship that quickly grows into a pack of misfit heroes, including Jules, a melodramatic dove, and Bully, a tough pit bull mix with a soft center. Together, they journey from small-town fields to the chaos of New York and the crashing waves of Atlantic City, rescuing animals, dodging danger, and winning hearts.<br> <br> But the world isn't just full of kind strangers and city lights. Something ancient and powerful watches from the shadows, a mythical creature, called the Umbrenox, drawn to Adonis and his friends for reasons beyond the waking world. As dreams blur with reality and a mysterious hunter closes in, the group must face a growing darkness that tests their loyalty, courage, and connection to something far greater than themselves.<br> <br> Full of humor, heart, and a touch of the surreal, Adonis’s Amazing Adventures is a whimsical, emotional journey about friendship, fear, and the magic that hides in the places we least expect.</p>"; 
